# Line endings. Every text file is stored with LF, whatever machine commits it:
# on 2026-10-14 four documents arrived from a Windows checkout with CRLF, and a
# whole file then showed as changed in every merge. Git converts on commit;
# binary files (Word exports, images, archives) are detected and left alone.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gds binary
*.bit binary
# vPlanner plans and other CSV files keep the line endings they were written
# with (CRLF, the CSV convention, which vPlanner reads): never converted.
*.csv -text
